      "sourceTextSha256": "efa081b00fef60ba90ce923abe355f673f8dadbb242edd78c870758c5ba38b4c",
      "text": "After breakfast, continue to the Monteverde cloud forest.\n\nSelvatura is set within the forest, where you can spend the day surrounded by dense vegetation.\n\nThe day includes several activities.\n\nFirst, take a canopy tour.\n\nYou will also visit a butterfly garden.\n\nSeparate exhibits are dedicated to reptiles and amphibians.\n\nThe itinerary also includes a sloth sanctuary.\n\nThe whole day is devoted to Monteverde’s natural sites and observing local wildlife.\n\nBreakfast is included.",
      "provenance": {
